notes               = "Untitled in source. Written two years after the August 1988 ceasefire and one of the clearest after-the-war poems in the book: بعد از جنگ opens it outright. The cave with waiting walls is the painter's studio seen as Lascaux. 7 Shahrivar = 29 August 1990. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
